    "regime_notes": "Full 15-instrument cross-asset universe used. The capped variant retains positive full-sample and recent 260-session predictive power, while the 520/780-session results are weaker but positive. The 20-session horizon is strongest, indicating persistence beyond the 10-session rebalance interval. Interpret uncertainty conservatively because the cross-section is small, with robustness primarily from 1,472 dates and multiple regimes.",
